The following legacy options have been removed as they had no effect in recent versions,
aren't documented well and it is currently not intended to support the use cases they once served:

* ``miscellaneous.docker_insecure_registries``
* ``miscellaneous.container_mirror_default_host``
* ``miscellaneous.configure_mirror_ca``

Mirrors can be configured via :ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.containerd.mirrors` now.
